00:02:09.571 --> 00:02:11.898
Reads a lot of romance
and thriller fiction,

00:02:12.431 --> 00:02:15.746
and she recently started
running Chop, Chat, and Connect,

00:02:16.047 --> 00:02:17.952
a user experience meetup in Ghana

00:02:17.976 --> 00:02:21.322
organized by her
and her team members at Ecobank.

